&lt;p data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1690&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is offered on a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;hybrid basis&lt;/strong&gt;, based from our Manchester office, UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1723&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1723&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What are the responsibilities of the role?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1724&quot; data-end=&quot;2584&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1724&quot; data-end=&quot;1918&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1918&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Building highly scalable, fault-tolerant distributed data processing systems (batch and streaming) that handle tens of terabytes of data each day, supporting a petabyte-scale data warehouse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;2038&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1921&quot; data-end=&quot;2038&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Designing and developing robust data solutions, streamlining complex datasets into simplified, self-service models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2134&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2134&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Developing pipelines that ensure high data quality and resilience to imperfect source data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;2135&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Defining and maintaining data mappings, business logic, transformations and data quality standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
