&lt;p data-start=&quot;2783&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with big data technologies such as HDFS, YARN, MapReduce, Hive, Kafka, Spark, Airflow, or Presto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
