&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission at HubSpot is to help millions of organizations grow better. As a Software Engineering Spring Co-op, you’ll help solve complex problems and build real products that thousands of customers depend on. You’ll work alongside HubSpot engineers in small, collaborative teams, with the opportunity to take ownership of the software you create and start shipping production code early in your co-op.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know there’s no such thing as a “perfect” candidate. Whatever your background or identity, we encourage you to apply if this role excites you and gives you an opportunity to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have the following roles open for our 2027 program in EMEA :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Co-ops &lt;/strong&gt;- Must be available to work full time for the duration of their required co-op placement (Start date: January - May 2027)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial placements -&lt;/strong&gt; Must be available to work full time for the duration of their required placement (Start date: June or July 2027) &lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;You must be available to work full time for the duration of the role and you must have at least a minimum of a 9 month mandatory placement as part of your course in order to apply for this role. Due to the nature of the role, this placement is being offered as a maximum of a 12 month contract.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship production software alongside experienced HubSpot engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex engineering problems that have an impact on HubSpot customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to back-end, front-end, or data and systems infrastructure projects based on your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers and teammates to design, develop, test, and improve software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of meaningful projects and contribute ideas from development through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn new technologies and engineering practices while applying them to real-world challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and collaborate with your team as you work through technical decisions and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
